1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,591
Despite the different approaches, there are patterns that everyone agrees on.

2
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:09,341
Concrete examples are worth more than abstract rules — one good example in a skill teaches more than five paragraphs of explanation.

3
00:00:09,341 --> 00:00:13,791
Always test before deploying — if you can't show that the skill changes the outcome, it's not ready.

4
00:00:13,791 --> 00:00:18,641
Keep the main file under five hundred lines — if it's longer, you're probably mixing concerns.

5
00:00:18,641 --> 00:00:20,958
And treat skills as living documents.

6
00:00:20,958 --> 00:00:25,833
The best skills I've seen evolved from real usage, not from a first draft that was written once and forgotten.

